	"Vader counts the tokens each provider reports. The money is worked out from list prices, so it is an estimate unless the provider billed it. Your provider’s own page is the bill.": "Vader 统计各提供商上报的 Token 数。金额按标价推算，因此除非提供商实际计费，否则只是估算。你的提供商自己的页面才是账单。",
