	"Vader sends nothing to a hosted service for it. What the program itself reaches out to is up to the program.": "Vader 不会为它向任何托管服务发送内容。程序本身会联系哪些地方由程序自己决定。",
	"Vader summarises the older messages before the next request, and keeps the newest ones as they are. Old tool output is dropped first.": "Vader 会在下一次请求前总结较早的消息，并保留最新的消息原样。旧的工具输出会最先被丢弃。",
